## CQ-CMP-22 | Corpse skeleton wears its curios, an Elytra Slot elytra and its cosmetic armor (look-check with CQ-CMP-18)
@group client
@commands Survival client, the CQ-CMP-21 kit plus a cosmetic gold helmet over an iron helmet; die; set `[corpses] skeletonTime = 200` in `config/creativecompat-common.toml` before the death (or wait 7 days) so the corpse turns skeleton; look at it, screenshot (F2); take the gold cosmetic helmet and the elytra out, look again; repeat once in the Nether so the corpse turns wither skeleton
