@pass `misc mods starting`, `feature ports (tier 1) starting`, `dead recipe removal starting`, `Coin starting` each once (from `server_scripts`, not the jar); no script error; recipe `creativecompat:` AE2 cable recipes still listed (`/kubejs` dump or JEI count unchanged); the jar lists `data/creativecompat/recipes/botanypots/crop/` (every file of the pack folder's crop tree, 39 on 2026-11-23) and both `tags/items/botany_pots/` tags
